[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0761","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0761.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21302","title":"Microsoft Windows 电话服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Telephony Service（TAPI）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过构造恶意的 RPC 请求或诱导用户访问恶意服务器触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。成功利用后攻击者可获取目标系统的完整控制权限，包括安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本（包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 系列），CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。利用需用户交互（如连接恶意 RPC 服务器），但无需身份认证。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21302"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:52Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:02Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5049984），Windows Server 用户请安装对应版本补丁（KB5049983/KB5050004/KB5050021/KB5049981）。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面限制 TAPI 服务的网络暴露，并禁用不必要的电话服务（TapiSrv）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21302","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21302.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21302.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21302.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21302.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/98e780f37def408177f986b78d0ac25d2ccbd10e/2025/CVE-2025-21302/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21302.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/98e780f37def408177f986b78d0ac25d2ccbd10e/2025/CVE-2025-21302/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21302.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb37