756","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0756.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21297","title":"Microsoft Windows 远程桌面服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 远程桌面服务（Remote Desktop Services）存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高（需在特定时间窗口内发送构造的数据包），但无需用户交互或任何权限，CVSS评分8.1，危害等级高。影响包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等多个版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21297"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:01Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050004），通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows Server 2008 R2 至 2025，更新后版本号分别为 6.1.7601.27520、6.2.9200.25273、6.3.9600.22371、10.0.14393.7699、10.0.17763.6775、10.0.20348.3091、10.0.25398.1369、10.0.26100.2894。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制 RDP 服务的公网暴露，启用网络级认证（NLA）并配置防火墙规则仅允许受信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21297","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-21297.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21297.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21297.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21297.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21297.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21297.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21297.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21297.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/f3beaa9a5afdeb6587a401b9765a1fb516f95853/2025/CVE-2025-21297/README.md","https://github.com/gengstah/gengstah.github.io/blob/059b3d7b4ee72f965889d7c8c8b8fd8dc6ac9ecf/_wiki/cves/CVE-2025-21297.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0756.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0755","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0755.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21296","title":"Microsoft Windows BranchCache 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows BranchCache 组件存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。BranchCache 是 Windows 中用于优化广域网带宽的分支机构缓存技术。由于 BranchCache 服务在处理特定网络请求时对内存对象生命周期管理不当，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的网络数据包触发释放后使用条件，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 多个版本及 Windows Server 2008 R2 至 2025 系列操作系统。攻击者需与目标处于同一相邻网络（AV:A），无需身份认证和用户交互，成功利用后可获取系统的完全控制权限。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21296"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:01Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050004）。Windows 10/11 用户通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新即可；Windows Server 2012 需先安装 SSU KB5050116 再安装 KB5050004；其他 Windows Server 版本对应更新见 MSRC 公告。如无法立即打补丁，建议在防火墙上限制对 BranchCache 服务的相邻网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21296","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21296.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21296.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21296.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21296.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/f3beaa9a5afdeb6587a401b9765a1fb516f95853/2025/CVE-2025-21296/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21296.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/f3beaa9a5afdeb6587a401b9765a1fb516f95853/2025/CVE-2025-21296/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21296.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2025/CVE-2025-21296.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21296"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0755.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0754","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0754.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21295","title":"Microsoft Windows SPNEGO 扩展协商安全机制远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows SPNEGO Extended Negotiation (NEGOEX) 安全机制存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 NEGOEX 协商请求，在内存对象被释放后仍对其进行访问，从而利用该漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。攻击复杂度较高，但无需身份认证和用户交互即可远程触发。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21295"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:01Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5050004，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可禁用 NEGOEX 协议作为临时缓解措施：在注册表 `HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Lsa\\` 下创建 `DisableNegoex` DWORD 值为 1。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21295","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21295.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21295.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21295.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21295.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/f3beaa9a5afdeb6587a401b9765a1fb516f95853/2025/CVE-2025-21295/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21295.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/f3beaa9a5afdeb6587a401b9765a1fb516f95853/2025/CVE-2025-21295/poc.py","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21295.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2025/CVE-2025-21295.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21295"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0754.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0753","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0753.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21294","title":"Microsoft Digest 身份验证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Digest 身份验证组件存在远程代码执行漏洞，该漏洞源于 Digest 认证协议在处理特定认证请求时存在内存损坏问题。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在无需用户交互的情况下，通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21294"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:01Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050061），涵盖 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 全系列受影响版本。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在域控和客户端上禁用 Digest 身份验证作为临时缓解措施：在注册表 `HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\SecurityProviders\\Digest` 中将 `Enabled` 设为 0，或通过组策略禁用 Digest 认证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21294","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21294.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21294.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21294.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21294.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21294.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21294.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c3d516d6bc446725f6492ed800c677df20d0d39c/2025/CVE-2025-21294.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21294","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21294.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21294"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0753.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0752","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0752.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21293","title":"Microsoft Active Directory Domain Services 权限提升漏洞","description":"Active Directory 域服务（AD DS）存在权限提升漏洞，由于对特权的访问控制措施不足，已通过身份验证的攻击者可利用该漏洞在目标系统上提升权限，从而获取对敏感资源的未授权访问。该漏洞影响多个 Windows Server 版本，攻击者需先获得低权限账户访问权，然后利用特制请求触发漏洞，实现权限提升。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21293"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:01Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050004)，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。对于无法立即打补丁的域控制器，可采取以下临时缓解措施：限制拥有域管理员权限的账户数量，启用高级安全审核策略监控异常权限提升行为，并在防火墙层面限制对域控制器的 LDAP/S 访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21293","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-21293.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2025/CVE-2025-21293.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/2ac59005f6e227f031caa7bd5f42ccb71cf13dd9/2025/CVE-2025-21293.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21293.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21293.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21293.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-21293.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21293.json","https://github.com/digitalinnovationone/dio-lab-open-source/blob/ecd965b50912527e94ecec0b57544239d48133fd/community/Rmns28.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/5fdf2422146ec927f5e2b344eb0d3699de2a8ba3/doc/2025-02/Active Directory Domain Services 权限提升漏洞 (CVE-2025-21293).md","https://github.com/ahmedumarehman/CVE-2025-21293"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0752.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0751","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0751.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21292","title":"Microsoft Windows Search Service 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Search 服务存在权限提升漏洞，由于该服务对用户输入的对象验证不足，低权限攻击者可登录目标系统后通过运行特制程序触发漏洞，利用该漏洞获取 SYSTEM 权限。成功利用此漏洞的攻击者可执行任意代码，并完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21292"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:50Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5049981)，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如无法立即打补丁，可在服务管理控制台 (services.msc) 中将 Windows Search 服务启动类型改为「禁用」并停止该服务，作为临时缓解措施。注意禁用搜索服务会影响文件搜索功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21292","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21292.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21292.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21292.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21292.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21292.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21292.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c3d516d6bc446725f6492ed800c677df20d0d39c/2025/CVE-2025-21292.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/74c8964553444e7157c19311801591437dc3229c/nvd/2025/HIGH/CVE-2025-21292/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21292.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21292"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0751.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0750","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0750.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21291","title":"Microsoft Windows Direct Show 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Direct Show 存在双重释放（Double Free）远程代码执行漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的媒体文件并诱导用户打开，触发内存损坏，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21291"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:50Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5049981，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制用户打开来自不受信任来源的媒体文件，并禁用不必要的 DirectShow 组件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21291","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21291.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21291.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21291.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21291.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21291.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21291.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21291.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/74a5eea2f8e7bbf8745be52f073af8f9cdbbb080/2025/CVE-2025-21291.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-21291","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21291"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],